  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://resource.swissartresearch.net/sari-image-classification/classificatorystatus/009dd5f35af91b263a586053494d699407afa4db/description">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>The image `009dd5f35af91b263a586053494d699407afa4db.jpg` was classified as a **drawing** with a confidence of **99.99%**.

This classification was generated by a fine-tuned **YOLOv11n-cls** model named [`yolo11n-cls-grp.pt`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) (from training run `train42`). The model was trained on the [`grp-image-classification-dataset-v2`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) dataset, which contains 2,183 human-annotated images across eight visual classes.

This machine-learning pipeline was developed and executed as part of the [SARI Image Classification project](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification), led by Matteo Romanello, to automatically classify images from the GRP collection for research purposes.</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
  </rdf:Description>
